stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROFILING: migration opened, isolated staging tenant created
    PROFILING --> MAPPING: artefacts profiled, out-of-range periods rejected early
    MAPPING --> STAGED: map confirmed, unmapped columns reported and never dropped
    STAGED --> STAGED: migration consent flow run, consent never imported or synthesised
    STAGED --> TIE_OUT_FAILED: any blocking head outside its tolerance, default zero
    TIE_OUT_FAILED --> STAGED: corrected at source, or overridden with a reason and an approver
    STAGED --> TIED_OUT: every blocking head ties to an independent record
    TIED_OUT --> PARALLEL_RUN: the source system's last closed month re-run in staging
    PARALLEL_RUN --> TIE_OUT_FAILED: diff is not zero on a blocking head
    PARALLEL_RUN --> READY_TO_CUT: diff reconciles to the rupee
    READY_TO_CUT --> TIE_OUT_FAILED: an EPF chronology gap is open on the establishment ledger
    READY_TO_CUT --> LIVE: promoted, source system stays readable
    LIVE --> LIVE: post-cutover changes are correction diffs, never re-imports
    PROFILING --> ABANDONED: abandoned before promotion
    MAPPING --> ABANDONED: abandoned before promotion
    STAGED --> ABANDONED: abandoned before promotion
    LIVE --> [*]
    ABANDONED --> [*]

    note right of READY_TO_CUT
        Rollback is free up to promotion
        and impossible after it
    end note
